{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgavxBB7DfKrGCwfzLV5T","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"I proved `factorialAcc_correct` in `Main.lean`, and `lean Main.lean` now runs with no errors or warnings.\n\nInduction on the original statement doesn't work directly, because the accumulator changes from `1` to `a * (n+1)` at each step. So I added a more general helper lemma first:\n\n```lean\ntheorem factorialAcc_aux (n a : Nat) : factorialAcc n a = a * factorial n := by\n  induction n generalizing a with\n  | zero => simp [factorialAcc, factorial]\n  | succ n ih =>\n    rw [factorialAcc, ih, factorial, Nat.mul_assoc]\n\ntheorem factorialAcc_correct (n : Nat) : factorialAcc n 1 = factorial n := by\n  rw [factorialAcc_aux, Nat.one_mul]\n```\n\nThe helper is proved by induction on `n`, with the accumulator `a` allowed to vary at each step. The main theorem then follows by setting `a = 1`, since `1 * factorial n = factorial n`."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":668,"cache_read_input_tokens":7971,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":668},"output_tokens":349,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"fc01562a-ded9-425a-9f15-f74eec48f0f2","uuid":"9263052a-394b-40a3-a85f-21c501c2248d","timestamp":"2026-10-31T20:17:01.854Z","request_id":"req_011CgavxAvUkvLD2ej7SjYLi"}
